WEBVTT

00:00:58.578 --> 00:01:00.434
and by the people that they work with.

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:04.450
So I'd like to share a few ideas
that create happy employees.

00:01:04.474 --> 00:01:06.094
Idea number one:

00:01:06.118 --> 00:01:08.761
in organizations
where employees are happy,

00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:10.868
what you find is two things are present:

00:01:10.892 --> 00:01:12.075
trust and respect.

00:01:12.432 --> 00:01:13.623
Leaders often say,

00:01:13.647 --> 00:01:15.019
"We trust our employees.

00:01:15.043 --> 00:01:16.535
We empower our employees."

00:01:16.559 --> 00:01:18.588
And then when an employee
needs a laptop --

00:01:18.612 --> 00:01:20.034
and this is a true example --

00:01:20.058 --> 00:01:22.784
15 people have to approve that laptop.

00:01:22.808 --> 00:01:25.102
So for the employee,
all the words are right,

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:28.963
but 15 levels of approval
for a $1,500 laptop?

00:01:28.987 --> 00:01:32.218
You've actually spent more money
than the laptop, on the approval.